WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,810 --> 00:00:02,710
Ling Yu

2
00:00:02,970 --> 00:00:04,690
Repeated injections are indeed a bit wasteful

3
00:00:04,930 --> 00:00:06,370
If you are willing to give up this time

4
00:00:06,650 --> 00:00:07,970
We are willing to compensate you

5
00:00:11,360 --> 00:00:15,620
The extraordinary human skin that the academician just revealed is for you.

6
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:22,820
The six bottles of high-quality yellow and foreign wine that I just rewarded will all belong to you. If the deal is broken, I will pretend to speak.

7
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:27,030
Do you have any objections to the compensation plan just now?

8
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:39,430
Ever since this kid Ling Yu retired from the mortal world,

9
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:41,230
The luck of our team

10
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:51,900
You've been deceived a lot. Uncle Zhao, little god, this is too valuable.

11
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:54,660
The team needs you to help me manage it. You need to become stronger.
